<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-CONTE WINS FIRST STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-CONTE WINS FIRST STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Spain 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biagio Conte of Italy won the 162 km opening stage of the Tour of Spain on Saturday.</p>
</text>
